    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to KOPI, a family-friendly cooking game that can be enjoyed solo or with friends in co-op mode. In KOPI, you'll craft increasingly elaborate drinks and dishes for ever-demanding customers. Whether you're brewing, cooking, frying, cleaning, or serving, remember: it\u2019s not over until the customer leaves happy. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Caf\u00e9s</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909960/extras/4cac245d4d6c42a27029e209a5e1b16c.avif?t=1754319764\" width=1486 height=1118 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become a coffee alchemist</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brew lattes, americanos, mochas, and whip up breakfasts and snacks that dance on the taste buds. Get the kitchen ready, roll up your sleeves, and let the customers pour in.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play for Laughs</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into the kitchen where the score doesn\u2019t matter, but the laughs are endless. It's all about the fun and ridiculousness of what you can cook up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Go Pro</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Channel your inner barista and race against the clock to serve as many drinks and dishes as possible, aiming for that elusive 3-star rating. Whether you\u2019re a master chef or a kitchen calamity, there\u2019s room for everyone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Recipes:</strong> Mix and match ingredients to create dishes and drinks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Environments:</strong> Explore different caf\u00e9 settings, each with unique challenges and charm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op Chaos:</strong> Team up with friends locally or online for cooperative gameplay that doubles the fun and the challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playful Visual Style:</strong> Delight in a playful visual style that transforms each scene into a charming miniature world.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to KOPI, a family-friendly cooking game that can be enjoyed solo or with friends in co-op mode. In KOPI, you'll craft increasingly elaborate drinks and dishes for ever-demanding customers. Whether you're brewing, cooking, frying, cleaning, or serving, remember: it\u2019s not over until the customer leaves happy. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Caf\u00e9s</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909960/extras/4cac245d4d6c42a27029e209a5e1b16c.avif?t=1754319764\" width=1486 height=1118 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become a coffee alchemist</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brew lattes, americanos, mochas, and whip up breakfasts and snacks that dance on the taste buds. Get the kitchen ready, roll up your sleeves, and let the customers pour in.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play for Laughs</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into the kitchen where the score doesn\u2019t matter, but the laughs are endless. It's all about the fun and ridiculousness of what you can cook up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Go Pro</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Channel your inner barista and race against the clock to serve as many drinks and dishes as possible, aiming for that elusive 3-star rating. Whether you\u2019re a master chef or a kitchen calamity, there\u2019s room for everyone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Recipes:</strong> Mix and match ingredients to create dishes and drinks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Environments:</strong> Explore different caf\u00e9 settings, each with unique challenges and charm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op Chaos:</strong> Team up with friends locally or online for cooperative gameplay that doubles the fun and the challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playful Visual Style:</strong> Delight in a playful visual style that transforms each scene into a charming miniature world.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Step into a lively, family-friendly cooking game where you brew, cook, fry, clean, and serve quirky customers. Earn coins, unlock levels, and experience a playful visual style that transforms each scene into a charming miniature world. Ensure every customer leaves with a smile!",
